<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-053" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-053-tanggu" source-id="s-sanguozhi-053-tanggu">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-053-tanggu:line036" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-tanggu:line036:m0002" ref="r2b_2xl_58l">澤</persName>州裡先輩丹楊<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-tanggu:line036:m0009" ref="s9q_djz_rgk">唐固</persName>亦修身積學，稱為儒者，著《國語》《公羊》《轂梁傳》注，講授常數十人。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-tanggu:line036:m0045" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>為吳王，拜<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-tanggu:line036:m0051" ref="s9q_djz_rgk">固</persName>儀郎，自<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-tanggu:line036:m0056" ref="lii_454_vuv">陸遜</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-tanggu:line036:m0059" ref="xuu_do0_zbf">張溫</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-tanggu:line036:m0062" ref="7tc_utz_m7l">駱統</persName>等皆拜之。黃武四年尚書僕射，卒。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-053-tanggu:line036-pei01-01" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note">吳錄曰：<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-tanggu:line036-pei01-01:m0004" ref="s9q_djz_rgk">固</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-tanggu:line036-pei01-01:m0006" ref="s9q_djz_rgk">子正</persName>，卒時年七十餘矣。</p>
</text>
